OL,3,GNEWSASenedd backs Newport M4 relief
OL,4,Aroad in symbolic vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Senedd has voted in favour of the
OL,7,Fprinciple of creating a motorway relief
OL,8,Froad around Newport.
OL,10,FThe non-binding motion - meaning the
OL,11,FWelsh government does not have to obey
OL,12,Fit - was tabled by Labour, despite the
OL,13,Fparty cancelling a proposed relief road
OL,14,Fwhen it was in office in 2019.
OL,16,FThe Plaid Cymru government published
OL,17,Fproposals to ease congestion by closing
OL,18,Fjunctions on the M4 this month.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
