OL,3,GNEWSASenedd backs Newport M4 relief
OL,4,Aroad in symbolic vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther options will also be considered,
OL,7,Fwhich could include building a new
OL,8,Fstretch of motorway or expanding the
OL,9,FBrynglas Tunnels.
